# Local deny-list for the pre-commit hook in scripts/check_denylist.py.
#
# Copy this file to .denylist (same folder) and replace the placeholders.
# .denylist is gitignored and must never be committed. One regular expression
# per line, matched case-insensitively against every staged file, every staged
# path, and git's user.name and user.email. Keep it to names that must never
# appear in this repo: former employers, their products, colleagues, and any
# work email address.
#
# Examples of the shape (these placeholders are safe to leave in):
example-employer-name
example-product-name
[a-z.]+@example-employer\.com
